          content: "Welcome to Citadel"
          fontSize: 34
      - id: "start-lede"
        type: "text"
        x: 0
        y: 70
        width: 560
        height: 90
        rotation: 0
        zIndex: 2
        locked: false
        visible: true
        opacity: 1
        tags: []
        meta:
          align: "left"
          content: "This project is a working tour. Every board shows something the app does — open the tabs above, and read the notes as you go."
          fontSize: 15
      - id: "start-move"
        type: "sticky"
        x: 0
        y: 190
        width: 250
        height: 150
        rotation: 0
        zIndex: 3
        locked: false
        visible: true
        opacity: 1
        tags:
          - "start"
          - "basics"
        meta:
          color: "#1d2a35"
          content: "Move around


            Hold Space and drag to pan. Wheel to zoom. Press F to fit the board to the window."
      - id: "start-tools"
        type: "sticky"
        x: 270
        y: 190
        width: 250
        height: 150
        rotation: 0
        zIndex: 4
        locked: false
        visible: true
        opacity: 1
        tags:
          - "start"
          - "basics"
        meta:
          color: "#1d2a35"
          content: "Pick a tool


            V select, C connect, N note, T text, K link. The toolbar names them all, and every one is rebindable in Settings."
      - id: "start-connect"
        type: "sticky"
        x: 540
        y: 190
        width: 250
        height: 150
        rotation: 0
        zIndex: 5
        locked: false
        visible: true
        opacity: 1
        tags:
          - "start"
          - "basics"
        meta:
          color: "#1d2a35"
          content: "Join things up


            With C, drag from one item to another. Give the connection a meaning so the link still says something later."
      - id: "start-find"
        type: "sticky"
        x: 0
        y: 370
        width: 250
        height: 150
        rotation: 0
        zIndex: 6
        locked: false
        visible: true
        opacity: 1
        tags:
          - "start"
        meta:
          color: "#1d2a35"
          content: "Find anything


            The Index searches every board at once — text, notes, tags, code and connections. Ctrl+K opens the command palette."
      - id: "start-review"
        type: "sticky"
        x: 270
        y: 370
        width: 250
        height: 150
        rotation: 0
        zIndex: 7
        locked: false
        visible: true
        opacity: 1
        tags:
          - "start"
          - "review"
        meta:
          color: "#1d2a35"
          content: "Look again


            Y cycles the vision checks. Shift+D runs a timed study session. Shift+T scrubs the board back through its own history."
      - id: "start-link"
        type: "sticky"
        x: 540
        y: 370
        width: 250
        height: 150
        rotation: 0
        zIndex: 8
        locked: false
        visible: true
        opacity: 1
        tags:
          - "start"
        meta:
          color: "#1d2a35"
          content: "Anything can carry a link


            This note opens the Citadel repository with the K tool. Only http, https and mailto are ever opened."
        link: "https://github.com/kannibalk1w1/Citadel"
      - id: "start-comment"
        type: "sticky"
        x: 820
        y: 190
        width: 210
        height: 120
        rotation: 0
        zIndex: 9
        locked: false
        visible: true
        opacity: 1
        tags: []
        meta:
          align: "left"
          attachedTo: "start-connect"
          color: "#241d16"
          content: "Comment pins attach to an item and travel with it. Ctrl+Shift+M adds one."
          fontSize: 13
          fontStyle: "normal"
          kind: "comment"
